# ReconDesk Project Context
Tech stack: FastAPI (Python 3.11), Next.js 14 App Router, Supabase PostgreSQL,
Cloudflare R2, Railway (backend), Vercel (frontend), Razorpay (payments)
Rules:
- Always use async/await in FastAPI routes
- Store all money as integer paise (1 rupee = 100 paise). Never float.
- Use Pydantic v2 for all data models
- Enable RLS only after auth + ownership model is implemented
- Python: use type hints on every function signature
- Every error message must say WHAT, WHICH RECORD, WHY, and WHAT TO DO
- Tests go in /tests. Run with: pytest tests/ -v